    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... it's constant. every time i think i'm getting better, something else breaks. it's like i'm just a collection of scars and mistakes. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person anymore, just this... wreckage. i don't think a person like me is even capable of being okay. i'm just tired of pretending that things can change.",
